DESCRIPTION:📚🚀✊🏿Join award-winning author and educator Nadia L.
  Hohn for the launch of her latest release\, STOP ANTIBLACK RACISM: 8 WAYS
  TO ACT NOW.\nIn this practical book\, part of the Take Action Series by O
 rca Book Publishers\, Hohn identifies 8 steps for everyone - Black and non
 -Black people - to combat anti-Black racism. Together the steps offer read
 ers practical ways to overcome ignorance\, take a stand\, and get back up 
 after experiencing racism. The book includes a glossary and a list of reso
 urces for further exploration of the topic.\nNadia is one of Toronto's fav
 ourite authors\, bringing tremendous experience in education and publishin
 g to her work - this is her 12th book! She not only writes but sings\, pla
 ys the piano\, draws - a true artivist! Come celebrate Nadia\, her creativ
 ity\, and her newest achievement\, STOP ANTIBLACK RACISM\, a book that tea
 ches us all to take action! #ReadDifferently #socialjustice #CanLit #Afric
 anCanadian📚
